        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG200-EU1656, Stainless Steel European Mortise Lock Lever Sets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEuropean style entry door leverset with satin stainless steel door levers and 2\" round roses. <b>European Mortise Lockcase:</b> Heavy duty for residential, commercial and multifamily housing. Entry door lock function uses single cylinder European profile cylinder with  Schlage C keyway. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/european-mortise-round-rose-leverset-ahi-sig200-eu1000\"><b>European Mortise Leverset</b></a> for interior doors and <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-european-mortise-lock-entry-leverset-ahi-sig203-eu1x56\"><b>Square Rose European Mortise Leverset</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b> Features</b> of the Round Rose European Mortise Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Faceplate: Stainless steel 20mm Wide x 235mm High</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: Zinc plated, Key action</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Double throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike plate: Stainless steel </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Round Rose European Lock Mortise Kit:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel </b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Hub: 8mm (5/16\") square</li> \r\n<li>Rose Plates: 50mm (2\") Round </li>\r\n<li>Rose Plate Thickness: 9mm (3/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" (38mm) minimum thickness, optional up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 70mm (2-3/4\"), 60mm (2-3/8\") or 50mm (2\")</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Handed, field reversible</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EU1000.pdf?v=1691093349\" target =\"new\"><b>AHI EU1000 Series European Mortise Lock Dimensions</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold as a set, (for 1 door). Set includes two (2) door levers with 50mm round roses, European profile cylinder with 50mm round roses, mortise lock case, face plate, strike plate, spindles and installation screws. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "European Mortise Lock Entry Leverset with Round Roses, AHI SIG200-EU1656",
